<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM WORLD DOUBLES CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM WORLD DOUBLES CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Connecticut 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>round-robin Phoenix/ATP Tour World Doubles Championship</p>
<p>Sunday:</p>
<p>Round robin, finals:</p>
<p>Mark Woodforde and Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Alex</p>
<p>O'Brien (U.S.) and Sebastien Lareau (Canada) 6-4 5-7 6- 2 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3)</p>
